        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short puzzle game, adventure through an unexplored jungle, looking for the fabled city of gold - ElDorado!<br><br>Navigate through numerous puzzles and temples to locate all the totems and keys required to unlock the door to ElDorado.<br><br>Each series of puzzles starts with an easier &quot;proof of concept&quot; version, to help outline how the area/temple will work moving forward.<br><br>Difficulty:<br>The puzzles aren't the easiest to solve, so may not be best suited to younger children.<br>If you get stuck, just remember - all solutions/answers are right in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from the Developer:<br>This is my first game, and would love to hear your feedback - good or bad - it's the only way to learn.<br>Feel free to review the game, or jump in the Discord to help me make bigger, better games.<br><br>If you take a chance on this game, I appreciate the support, and hope you enjoy it!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short puzzle game, adventure through an unexplored jungle, looking for the fabled city of gold - ElDorado!<br><br>Navigate through numerous puzzles and temples to locate all the totems and keys required to unlock the door to ElDorado.<br><br>Each series of puzzles starts with an easier &quot;proof of concept&quot; version, to help outline how the area/temple will work moving forward.<br><br>Difficulty:<br>The puzzles aren't the easiest to solve, so may not be best suited to younger children.<br>If you get stuck, just remember - all solutions/answers are right in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from the Developer:<br>This is my first game, and would love to hear your feedback - good or bad - it's the only way to learn.<br>Feel free to review the game, or jump in the Discord to help me make bigger, better games.<br><br>If you take a chance on this game, I appreciate the support, and hope you enjoy it!</p>",
        "short_description": "Explore the forests and temples of a remote island in search of the fabled city of gold - &quot;ElDorado&quot;. Solve a series of puzzles to unlock the doorway to endless riches.",
